# "sync bass" on the bass track (mono): low notes down to C1, the sub coming in (P2 0 -> 128) and the ratio
# stepping between notes, plus "pluck bass" envelopes.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 70 100 0 70 150 25 0 0 128 0 128 205 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C2 2 127
note 2 C2 1 70
note 3 G1 1 100
note 4 Bb1 2 127
param p2 0 6
sweep p2 0 128 6 14
note 6 F1 4 110
note 10 C1 4 127
param p1 140 14
note 14 Eb2 2 127
param p1 100 16
param decay 40 16
param sustain 0 16
note 16 C2 1 127
note 17 C2 1 90
note 18 G1 1 127
note 19 C2 1 60
param p1 200 20
note 20 C1 2 127
note 22 C2 2 127
param p1 45 24
param p2 128 24
param sustain 200 24
note 24 C1 8 127
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 50
expect peak_below -6
